    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2109150/extras/bc8a0f89bd0af90adba0dc7a108f9bd9.poster.avif?t=1661997978\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2109150/extras/bc8a0f89bd0af90adba0dc7a108f9bd9.webm?t=1661997978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2109150/extras/bc8a0f89bd0af90adba0dc7a108f9bd9.mp4?t=1661997978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>This game is free to play, you can experience the full twelve levels<br><strong>[Game description]</strong><br>In this light-hearted adventure game, you'll need to help GC Lady defeat the boss by completing a variety of levels! Explore the various modes and make sure you defeat the boss before the strawberries return to 0!<br>\u25c6Each level is played differently<br>\u25c6Includes touching items, picking things up, dialogue options, eliminating dropped objects, shooting battles, card battles, puzzles and other gameplay<br>\u25c6Cute pixel style<br>\u25c6Strawberries will be lost when the level challenge is failed, and strawberries are equal to life value and the final score settlement<br><br>You will help GC Lady! Complete the challenge by playing in different levels in different ways.<br>From left and right touch to dodge the pigeon, and then shoot, there are twelve kinds of levels to experience.<br><br><strong>\u3010Game start\u3011</strong><br>At the beginning of the game, you will have 5 strawberries, which will be your HP to play this game.<br>When 5 strawberries are deducted, the game ends and the total score is calculated.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2109150/extras/4f860e27641300d160e9ec1bde6cbd9f.avif?t=1661997978\" /></div><br><br><strong>[Button Tips]</strong><br>Each level will have action tips before starting, please follow the action tips to play.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2109150/extras/47d4bf9b570d5126d3f8a6d4d17d34dd.avif?t=1661997978\" /></div><br><br><strong>[Game Objective]</strong><br>Get as high a score as possible at the end of the level.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2109150/extras/dff24a319e57b11800b50dd219a0bfbd.avif?t=1661997978\" /></div><br><br><strong>[Extra points]</strong><br>Some of the levels have an extra point race setting. When the time set for the level is met, the extra point race will be opened to challenge for a higher score.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2109150/extras/77efe31f65a9772d18434bce95b605d0.avif?t=1661997978\" /></div><br><br><strong>\u3010Gameplay Explanation \u2460\u3011</strong><br>In this level, when an apple falls in the blue triangle, press and hold A or D on the keyboard to eliminate it, otherwise an apple will be deducted<br>When the score exceeds twenty points, no strawberry (HP) will be deducted.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2109150/extras/b0baf47ef7e77eb3ebd46d11ae2b089e.poster.avif?t=1661997978\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2109150/extras/b0baf47ef7e77eb3ebd46d11ae2b089e.webm?t=1661997978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2109150/extras/b0baf47ef7e77eb3ebd46d11ae2b089e.mp4?t=1661997978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>\u3010Game play explanation\u2461\u3011</strong><br>Long press and drag the GC lady to keep the GC lady from being touched by the pigeon. Hold on for more than 30 seconds to win!<br>Otherwise you will deduct one strawberry (HP)<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2109150/extras/e1edcf110da3d3d76462d139c2f4e677.poster.avif?t=1661997978\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2109150/extras/e1edcf110da3d3d76462d139c2f4e677.webm?t=1661997978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2109150/extras/e1edcf110da3d3d76462d139c2f4e677.mp4?t=1661997978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>\u3010Playing explanation \u2462\u3011</strong><br>Keyboard A or D to dodge the GC ball, space to attack the GC ball.<br>Fail when life value is 0, deduct one strawberry (HP)<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2109150/extras/885af533b9b2407b01b2c2e3e812f618.poster.avif?t=1661997978\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2109150/extras/885af533b9b2407b01b2c2e3e812f618.webm?t=1661997978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2109150/extras/885af533b9b2407b01b2c2e3e812f618.mp4?t=1661997978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>[more levels to play please explore through the button prompts]<br><br><strong>[Character Introduction]</strong><br><strong>GC Lady</strong><br>In the game you will help GC Lady to avoid danger and defeat the boss!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2109150/extras/ac2eee637ee67d02ae018b854a5240b3.avif?t=1661997978\" /></div><br><br><strong>GC Ball</strong><br>In-game boss, source unknown<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2109150/extras/c6964a3cf031faae8d8a5abd4d53caa8.avif?t=1661997978\" /></div><br><br><strong>Goo Goo Goo</strong><br>The divine beast with the power of the dove seems to be hinting at something<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2109150/extras/77acc2d7ccd416465e63caf95d2b5cca.avif?t=1661997978\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2109150/extras/bc8a0f89bd0af90adba0dc7a108f9bd9.poster.avif?t=1661997978\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2109150/extras/bc8a0f89bd0af90adba0dc7a108f9bd9.webm?t=1661997978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2109150/extras/bc8a0f89bd0af90adba0dc7a108f9bd9.mp4?t=1661997978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>This game is free to play, you can experience the full twelve levels<br><strong>[Game description]</strong><br>In this light-hearted adventure game, you'll need to help GC Lady defeat the boss by completing a variety of levels! Explore the various modes and make sure you defeat the boss before the strawberries return to 0!<br>\u25c6Each level is played differently<br>\u25c6Includes touching items, picking things up, dialogue options, eliminating dropped objects, shooting battles, card battles, puzzles and other gameplay<br>\u25c6Cute pixel style<br>\u25c6Strawberries will be lost when the level challenge is failed, and strawberries are equal to life value and the final score settlement<br><br>You will help GC Lady! Complete the challenge by playing in different levels in different ways.<br>From left and right touch to dodge the pigeon, and then shoot, there are twelve kinds of levels to experience.<br><br><strong>\u3010Game start\u3011</strong><br>At the beginning of the game, you will have 5 strawberries, which will be your HP to play this game.<br>When 5 strawberries are deducted, the game ends and the total score is calculated.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2109150/extras/4f860e27641300d160e9ec1bde6cbd9f.avif?t=1661997978\" /></div><br><br><strong>[Button Tips