me boss, source unknown<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2109150/extras/c6964a3cf031faae8d8a5abd4d53caa8.avif?t=1661997978\" /></div><br><br><strong>Goo Goo Goo</strong><br>The divine beast with the power of the dove seems to be hinting at something<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2109150/extras/77acc2d7ccd416465e63caf95d2b5cca.avif?t=1661997978\" /></div>",
